# Chapter X, the final battle: Arkt waits in the church at Melee and leads the
# player into his tower, through the ovens, the wall tower and its Void to the
# top. His shade falls first; then Arkt himself, in Calisto's form, grows and
# fights, and his defeat sends the player home to Stormwend.
# Position stands in for the walks and damage for the fights; ref FormIDs
# carry Arktwend's slot 05.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --from final_melee
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

# Arkt in the monastery church, and the portal behind him.
case final_melee
run
player->PositionCell 7979 14000 804 0 "Melee Monastery Church"
until 600 MenuMode == 1
wait 60
bye
run
player->PositionCell 7993 14844 801 0 "Melee Monastery Church"
until 300 GetPCCell "Arkt's Tower, Ovens" == 1
end

# Out of the tower onto its top, where Arkt's shade lies in wait.
case final_shade
run
player->PositionCell -321 -400 1263 0 "Arkt's Tower, Upper Area"
activate 05D92593
until 300 player->GetPos y > 400000
run
player->Position -163406 429500 10273 0
until 600 MenuMode == 1
wait 60
bye
console 0546FBF4.damageav health 100000
until 600 Storyvar == 79
end

# Arkt in Calisto's form tells his true intentions, and fights.
case final_arkt
until 300 "ArktCalisto"->GetDisabled == 0
run
player->Position -163466 429400 10272 0
until 600 MenuMode == 1
wait 60
ask true intentions
choose 1
choose 2
bye
until 600 "ArktCalisto"->GetScale > 1.5
console 055B5654.damageav health 100000
button 0
expect GetJournalIndex A_X_Final_Battle == 10
until 300 GetPCCell "Tournament Plaza" == 1
expect Storyvar == 80
end
